<center>
    <table border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
      <tr>
        <td width="78%" valign="top"><font face="Verdana,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" size="-2">
        <center>
	<!-- NP v3.7.4 -->
	<a name="newsitem966450614,72823,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, August 16, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>Show Respect to other Servers</b></u><br>Someone was on the Artic server last night claiming to be a GM from GameRealm and saying "GameRealm is out to get all the users from other servers, and put them under. We're at war!". I will tell you now this is not a view of the staff of GameRealm! I have asked the admin of the Artic server to get me the IP Address of the user who did this and if I can match it up to one of our users I will Ban that user from GameRealm!<br><br>Listen folks, PLEASE show respect to other servers when playing on other servers and posting on any Message Board! I will not tolerate this kind of trash talking!<br><br><b><u>GameRealm Main T4C Server</b></u><br>The GameRealm Main T4C Server is now a FREE Server! If you want to come join the most exciting Server on the net, what are you waiting for? We are still offering our $50 Lifetime accounts and we are now also offering Free Lifetime Accounts! So <a href="http://www.gamerealm.com/signup.asp">Sign Up</a> now!<br><br><b><u>Free Lifetime Account</b></u><br>*One Free Lifetime Account Access to our Main T4C Server<br><br><b><u>$50 Members Account</b></u><br>*One Lifetime Member Account Access to our Main T4C Server<br>*Access to any future T4C Servers we may add<br>*You get one Vote in Server Votes for settings and the direction of the game<br>*Special Raids & Events for Members only<br>*Access to Reroll (Via Quests)<br>*More to be announced</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem965862221,93178,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, August 9, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>Top T4C Players</b></u><br>We have a new top 10 list for the best T4C Players in the world! Some people ask why they are the best in the world? The answer is really simple, no other server has the challenge that Chaos does! Chaos has no gm run events that will enhance a character (raids and events only give extra exp and item enhancements that clearly raise a character's level), Chaos has no illegal content (very rare these days) and Chaos has the Hardest settings anywhere! 100% equipped item, 100% gold drop and 100% backpack drop on death by monsters and PvP as well as 100% exp loss of your last level when killed by a monster! Chaos is a extremely hard server, only for the best of the best! <br><br><b>Current Top Ten T4C Players in the World<br>Namtar 90th lvl <i>**First Chaos Player to hit 90th lvl**</i><br>Cujo 89th lvl<br>PK 85th lvl<br>SnakE 81st lvl<br>Gambitte 76th lvl<br>Otigon 75th lvl<br>Xiao Yan Zi 75th lvl<br>Tynargelath 74th lvl<br>Evincar of Rath 72nd lvl<br>Plump 72nd lvl</b><br><br>Congrats to our top ten players!</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem965165073,70842,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Tuesday, August 1, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>New 116 Patch</b></u><br>The new 116 Patch has been updated to both the Main and the Chaos Server. Please take a look at <a href="http://www.t4cportal.com">T4C Portal</a> for info on the new patch.</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem964649690,53109,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Wednesday, July 26, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>NEW CHAOS EXTREME</b></u><br>Chaos Server is becoming a proving ground for who's the best of the best! When the new Isle is released there will be a defining way to end the game for a player (We don't want to give the details away, players must discover it on their own but rest assured there will be no doubt if you have reached this point) and the first player to bring this about (again we are having to be vague about the details) will be declared The Best T4C Player in the World and will hold a spot in the gamerealm Hall of Fame (soon to be built) as well as be rewarded with $100 and we will allow the player to move their account to our Main T4C Server (we will allow the Top 10 players to move their characters over to our Main T4C Server).<br><br>Once we find out who is the Best T4C Player in the World, Chaos Server will be wiped (We are guessing it will be another 7 months to a year before this will happen) and we will start all over again!<br><br>So let Chaos Rule and only the Best will Survive!</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem964548690,49395,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Tuesday, July 25, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>Automatic Password Change for Chaos Server</b></u><br>Did you forget your password? Did you want to change your password? Hector is here to server you, click <a href="http://t4c.isomedia.com/t4csignup/addchaosuser.asp?idiot=1">Here</a> to get a new password (you can also find a link on the Chaos Sign Up page).<br><br><b><u>New 115a Patch</b></u><br>We will be bringing both servers down to apply the new 115a patch, this is a server side patch that is suppose to help stop Server crashes.<br><br><b><u>New Setting for Chaos Server</b></u><br>Due to the nature of the new release of the 115 patch, we can no longer take 10% of total exp from players on death from monsters, the new setting takes a amount of exp from your last level. We have set the exp loss to 100% from your last level, this ends up not being a very big exp loss and we are working with Vircom now hoping to get our old settings back.</font></td></tr></table><p>
<a name="newsitem964197304,67913,"></a>
<table border="0" width="93%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">              <tr><td width="100%" bgcolor="blue"><font face="Arial" size="2" color="white"><b>Friday, July 21, 2000<small> Posted by Shane</small></b></font></td></tr><tr><td width="100%"><font face="Arial" size="2"><BR><b><u>Servers Updated</b></u><br>Both the Main T4C Server and the Chaos Server are now running the new 115 patch, be warned you will be naked when you log on, all your items are in your backpack.<br><br><b><u>New 115 Patch Released</b></u><br>The new 115 patch was released today, the new patch includes the long awaited Archer and also includes quite a few bug fixes, I will post the release notes once we get them.</font></td></tr></table><p>

